a>.","es_ES":"Acepto que mis datos se utilicen para responder a mi solicitud. Más información en la <a href=\"%privacy_url%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">política de privacidad</a>.","fr_FR":"J’accepte que mes données soient utilisées pour traiter ma demande. Plus d’informations dans la <a href=\"%privacy_url%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">politique de confidentialité</a>.","it_IT":"Acconsento all’uso dei miei dati per rispondere alla mia richiesta. Maggiori informazioni nell’<a href=\"%privacy_url%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">informativa sulla privacy</a>."}}}],"showBottomBar":true,"layout":{"columns":{"desktop":2,"mobile":1}}},{"id":"end","type":"end","success":{"show":true,"heading":{"en_US":"Thank you, {{field:name}}!","de_DE":"Vielen Dank, {{field:name}}!","de_DE_formal":"Vielen Dank, {{field:name}}!","es_ES":"¡Gracias, {{field:name}}!","fr_FR":"Merci, {{field:name}} !","it_IT":"Grazie, {{field:name}}!"},"text":{"en_US":"<p>Your request has arrived. We will call or e-mail you shortly to arrange a time that suits you.</p><h3>What happens now?</h3><ol><li>We read your answers.</li><li>We get in touch within one working day to find a time.</li><li>In a free first conversation we talk about your options.</li></ol>","de_DE":"<p>Deine Anfrage ist bei uns angekommen. Wir melden uns in Kürze, um einen passenden Termin zu vereinbaren.</p><h3>Was passiert jetzt?</h3><ol><li>Wir lesen deine Angaben.</li><li>Wir melden uns innerhalb eines Werktags für einen Termin.</li><li>Im kostenlosen Erstgespräch besprechen wir deine Möglichkeiten.</li></ol>","de_DE_formal":"<p>Ihre Anfrage ist bei uns angekommen. Wir melden uns in Kürze, um einen passenden Termin zu vereinbaren.</p><h3>Was passiert jetzt?</h3><ol><li>Wir lesen Ihre Angaben.</li><li>Wir melden uns innerhalb eines Werktags für einen Termin.</li><li>Im kostenlosen Erstgespräch besprechen wir Ihre Möglichkeiten.</li></ol>","es_ES":"<p>Hemos recibido tu solicitud. Te llamaremos o escribiremos en breve para acordar una cita.</p><h3>¿Qué pasa ahora?</h3><ol><li>Leemos tus respuestas.</li><li>Te contactamos en un día laborable para fijar una cita.</li><li>En una primera conversación gratuita vemos tus opciones.</li></ol>","fr_FR":"<p>Votre demande nous est bien parvenue. Nous vous contactons rapidement pour convenir d’un rendez-vous.</p><h3>Et maintenant ?</h3><ol><li>Nous lisons vos réponses.</li><li>Nous vous contactons sous un jour ouvré pour fixer un rendez-vous.</li><li>Lors d’un premier échange gratuit, nous voyons vos options.</li></ol>","it_IT":"<p>Abbiamo ricevuto la tua richiesta. Ti contatteremo a breve per fissare un appuntamento.</p><h3>E adesso?</h3><ol><li>Leggiamo le tue risposte.</li><li>Ti contattiamo entro un giorno lavorativo per fissare un appuntamento.</li><li>In un primo colloquio gratuito parliamo delle tue possibilità.</li></ol>"},"animation":"check","button":{"label":{"en_US":"Back to the website","de_DE":"Zurück zur Website","de_DE_formal":"Zurück zur Website","es_ES":"Volver a la web","fr_FR":"Retour au site","it_IT":"Torna al sito"},"url":{"en_US":"%home_url%","de_DE":"%home_url%","de_DE_formal":"%home_url%","es_ES":"%home_url%","fr_FR":"%home_url%","it_IT":"%home_url%"}}},"redirect":null}],"edges":[{"id":"e_cover_1","from":"cover","to":"company","when":{"field":"q_cover","op":"selected","value":"o_cover_business"}},{"id":"e_cover_2","from":"cover","to":"who","default":true},{"id":"e_who_1","from":"who","to":"current","default":true},{"id":"e_company_1","from":"company","to":"current","default":true},{"id":"e_current_1","from":"current","to":"start","default":true},{"id":"e_start_1","from":"start","to":"channel","default":true},{"id":"e_channel_1","from":"channel","to":"contact","default":true},{"id":"e_contact_1","from":"contact","to":"end","default":true}],"calculations":[],"actions":[{"id":"a_owner","on":"submit","kind":"email","config":{"to":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"cc":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"bcc":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"from":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"fromName":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"replyTo":{"en_US":"{{field:email}}","de_DE":"{{field:email}}","de_DE_formal":"{{field:email}}","es_ES":"{{field:email}}","fr_FR":"{{field:email}}","it_IT":"{{field:email}}"},"subject":{"en_US":"New insurance enquiry: {{field:cover}} · {{field:start}}","de_DE":"Neue Versicherungsanfrage: {{field:cover}} · {{field:start}}","de_DE_formal":"Neue Versicherungsanfrage: {{field:cover}} · {{field:start}}","es_ES":"Nueva consulta de seguros: {{field:cover}} · {{field:start}}","fr_FR":"Nouvelle demande d’assurance: {{field:cover}} · {{field:start}}","it_IT":"Nuova richiesta assicurativa: {{field:cover}} · {{field:start}}"},"body":{"en_US":"You have a new entry from \"{{form:title}}\".\n\n{{lead}}\n\nAnswers:\n{{answers}}","de_DE":"Neuer Eintrag aus „{{form:title}}“.\n\n{{lead}}\n\nAntworten:\n{{answers}}","de_DE_formal":"Neuer Eintrag aus „{{form:title}}“.\n\n{{lead}}\n\nAntworten:\n{{answers}}","es_ES":"Nueva entrada de «{{form:title}}».\n\n{{lead}}\n\nRespuestas:\n{{answers}}","fr_FR":"Nouvelle entrée de « {{form:title}} ».\n\n{{lead}}\n\nRéponses :\n{{answers}}","it_IT":"Nuova voce da «{{form:title}}».\n\n{{lead}}\n\nRisposte:\n{{answers}}"},"nl2br":true,"transport":{"type":"wp_mail"},"layout":"branded"}},{"id":"a_reply","on":"submit","kind":"autoresponder","config":{"to":{"en_US":"{{field:email}}","de_DE":"{{field:email}}","de_DE_formal":"{{field:email}}","es_ES":"{{field:email}}","fr_FR":"{{field:email}}","it_IT":"{{field:email}}"},"cc":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"bcc":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"from":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"fromName":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"replyTo":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"subject":{"en_US":"We have received your request","de_DE":"Wir haben deine Anfrage erhalten","de_DE_formal":"Wir haben Ihre Anfrage erhalten","es_ES":"Hemos recibido tu solicitud","fr_FR":"Nous avons bien reçu votre demande","it_IT":"Abbiamo ricevuto la tua richiesta"},"body":{"en_US":"Hello {{field:name}},\n\nthank you for your request. We have received your details and will get back to you within one working day.\n\nWhat happens now?\n1. We read your answers.\n2. We get in touch within one working day to find a time.\n3. In a free first conversation we talk about your options.\n\nYour answers:\n{{answers}}\n\nKind regards","de_DE":"Hallo {{field:name}},\n\nvielen Dank für deine Anfrage. Wir haben deine Angaben erhalten und melden uns innerhalb eines Werktags.\n\nWas passiert jetzt?\n1. Wir lesen deine Angaben.\n2. Wir melden uns innerhalb eines Werktags für einen Termin.\n3. Im kostenlosen Erstgespräch besprechen wir deine Möglichkeiten.\n\nDeine Angaben:\n{{answers}}\n\nViele Grüße","de_DE_formal":"Hallo {{field:name}},\n\nvielen Dank für Ihre Anfrage. Wir haben Ihre Angaben erhalten und melden uns innerhalb eines Werktags.\n\nWas passiert jetzt?\n1. Wir lesen Ihre Angaben.\n2. Wir melden uns innerhalb eines Werktags für einen Termin.\n3. Im kostenlosen Erstgespräch besprechen wir Ihre Möglichkeiten.\n\nIhre Angaben:\n{{answers}}\n\nViele Grüße","es_ES":"Hola, {{field:name}}:\n\ngracias por tu solicitud. Hemos recibido tus datos y te responderemos en un día laborable.\n\n¿Qué pasa ahora?\n1. Leemos tus respuestas.\n2. Te contactamos en un día laborable para fijar una cita.\n3. En una primera conversación gratuita vemos tus opciones.\n\nTus respuestas:\n{{answers}}\n\nUn saludo","fr_FR":"Bonjour {{field:name}},\n\nmerci pour votre demande. Nous avons bien reçu vos informations et revenons vers vous sous un jour ouvré.\n\nEt maintenant ?\n1. Nous lisons vos réponses.\n2. Nous vous contactons sous un jour ouvré pour fixer un rendez-vous.\n3. Lors d’un premier échange gratuit, nous voyons vos options.\n\nVos réponses :\n{{answers}}\n\nBien cordialement","it_IT":"Ciao {{field:name}},\n\ngrazie per la tua richiesta. Abbiamo ricevuto i tuoi dati e ti risponderemo entro un giorno lavorativo.\n\nE adesso?\n1. Leggiamo le tue risposte.\n2. Ti contattiamo entro un giorno lavorativo per fissare un appuntamento.\n3. In un primo colloquio gratuito parliamo delle tue possibilità.\n\nLe tue risposte:\n{{answers}}\n\nCordiali saluti"},"nl2br":true,"transport":{"type":"wp_mail"},"layout":"branded","recipientField":"c_email"}}],"style":{"preset":"default","theme":"corporate","tokens":{"color.primary":"#2563eb","color.onPrimary":"#ffffff","color.background":"#ffffff","color.text":"#1e293b","color.muted":"#475569","color.border":"#cbd5e1","color.error":"#b42318","font.family":"system-ui","radius.card":"6","radius.input":"6"}},"settings":{"uiLocale":"","progressBar":{"show":true},"loadingAnimation":false,"scrollToTop":{"desktop":false,"mobile":true},"rtl":false,"autoHeight":true,"iconFont":false,"savePartialEntries":false},"layout":{"nodes":{"cover":{"x":0,"y":0},"who":{"x":340,"y":0},"company":{"x":340,"y":200},"current":{"x":680,"y":0},"start":{"x":1020,"y":0},"channel":{"x":1360,"y":0},"contact":{"x":1700,"y":0},"end":{"x":2040,"y":0}}},"meta":{"template":"insurance"}}
